Glacier is a Joker world and the opposite of [[Geography/Hellsmith|Hellsmith]]: a [[Færrin]] altogether bound in ice, as though an ice age came and never ended. Water and ice elementals and kinds that prefer the cold live there.

It lies beside Hellsmith, and its people are at war with Hellsmith's across the border.
